{"correlation_id": "8c04bf86-9783-40f6-b93c-5a0482a6d8ea", "event": "final_received", "final": {"answer": "The corrected final answer is: Renters insurance is intended to protect tenants against financial loss from various perils, including damage to the property from accidents, liability claims from others injured on the property, and personal belongings theft or damage.", "correlation_id": "8c04bf86-9783-40f6-b93c-5a0482a6d8ea", "draft": "Renters insurance is intended to protect tenants against financial loss from damage to the property from accidents, liability claims from others injured on the property, and personal belongings theft or damage.", "from_stage": "reviewer", "input_source": {"offset": 15, "partition": 0, "topic": "s6102_drafts"}, "plan": "Renters insurance is intended to protect tenants against financial loss from various perils, including damage to the property from accidents, liability claims from others injured on the property, and personal belongings theft or damage.", "question": "What is renters insurance intended to protect?", "rental_context": {"data_version": 12, "dataset_id": "0e586d72da6211f1ae011ab4cc3919df", "listings": [], "requested_codes": []}, "run_id": "question-8c04bf86-9783-40f6-b93c-5a0482a6d8ea", "status": "approved", "writer_instance": "writer-7100"}, "offset": 15, "partition": 0, "pid": 7197, "run_id": "question-8c04bf86-9783-40f6-b93c-5a0482a6d8ea", "source_commit": "52c8ef470b124605a0fc51dd8c5821b4a5f3738b", "student": "Pragya Apurva", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T04:21:36.127927+00:00", "topic": "s6102_final"}
